    "body": "Claim released. I stopped before Step 6 because I cannot complete the required PathPilot Hub 1300PL run in this session. https://hub.pathpilot.com redirects to https://hub.pathpilot.com/login. This session has no browser-control tool or connected Hub session. The worker instructions forbid entering tokens or passwords. The referenced hub-sim-setup notes are also absent from this checkout. No simulator cycle time or last executed line was measured.\n\nUpstream main is 8719d8b7a028f0c93cc78fe32ccbfdf5297a0dca. It has no first-plasma-part tutorial or downloadable demo. No open PR overlaps the planned paths.\n\nThe pin first_plasma_part_demo_regenerates_and_posts_inside_features_first compiled and failed on unchanged code because site/static/demos/first-plasma-part.camproj is missing. The failure is Io(NotFound), not a build error. The log is local at /tmp/issue-1905-pin-red.txt.\n\nThe uncommitted pin is held locally at /Users/mikekinney/CamcraftPool/.claude/worktrees/issue-1905/crates/app/tests/first_plasma_part.rs on issue/1905-first-plasma-part. No tutorial, demo, or production code changed. No commit, push, or PR was created. Mutation checks and the quick gate were not run. Resume needs an accessible authenticated Hub simulator and its setup notes to meet the issue acceptance criteria.\n",
